Kirsten, while still relatively new to coaching, has spent years working to discover,
accept, and expres her own authentic sexual self. She has spent time
learning to reconsile feminism against her own desire to submit, and
working through guilt and shame about her diversity of sexual desires
and fantasies and openness. 

She has spent years helping friends and partners name what they want
out loud for themselves in order to establish clear consent. 
She now works with individuals and couples on desire, communication, and consensual
exploration of kink, at whatever pace feels right.

Certified in sex and intimacy coaching, with additional training in
consent-based kink education.
